  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5/6) × (3/7) + y = (29/63)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n(5/6) × (3/7) + y = (29/63)\n\n⇒ (15/42) + y = (29/63)\n\n⇒ y = (29/63) - (15/42)\n\n⇒ y = (58 - 45)/126\n\n⇒ y = 13/126\n\nNow for the value of (10y - 1)\n\n(10y - 1) = 10(13/126) - 1\n\n⇒ (130/126) - 1 \n\n⇒ (130 - 126)/126\n\n⇒ 4 / 126 = 2/63\n\n**∴ The value of (10y - 1) is 2/63.**",
